# `**/bin/`, not `bin/`. A .dockerignore pattern is matched against the whole path, so `bin/`
# excludes only a bin directory at the context root. With 23 projects the build output now lives
# at src/Modules/<Module>/<Project>/bin, and the un-prefixed pattern let every one of them into
# the build context -- hundreds of megabytes, and stale assemblies shadowing a fresh restore.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.env
.env.*
.azure/
*.db
*.db-*
*.bak*
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
